    "what_en": "Adds captions to an existing single-subject talking-head video without touching the footage. It transcribes and mattes locally, picks one of 35 catalog styles, defaults to a quiet lower-third rail, and embeds only peak words behind the subject.",
    "when_en": "Triggers on an existing single-subject talking-head clip when you want captions or VFX-style titles; routing is by visual identity. Multi-speaker, subject-free, or already-captioned clips are refused.",
